### GET request to read all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### POST request to create a new user 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "img": "/userProflie/img_002.png",
        "userName": "John",
        "userLast": "Doe",
        "email": "john.doe@example.com",
        "phoneNumber": "0812345678",
        "address": "123 Sukhumvit Road, Khlong Tan, Bangkok, Thailand",
        "password":123456
}

### DELETE request to delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/11

### POST Login a user
POST  http://localhost:3000/api/v2/users/auth/cookie/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "zumba@example.com", 
    "password": "password123"
}

### POST Logout a user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/users/auth/cookie/logout

### GET check user authentication 
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/users/auth/cookie/me

### Ask AI
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/users/auth/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "Who are admins?",
    "topK": 5
}